+RIPPER
+NOINTERACTION
+PIERCEARMOR
+DONTREFLECT
+DONTBLAST
ReactionTime 350
damage (200)
Radius 16
Height 75
Speed 20
Scale 15
States
{
Spawn:
8P29 Q 0
